<h2 class="doc-h2">Custom Close Button</h2>
<p class="doc-note">
    <code>formmethod="dialog"</code> closes the <code>&lt;dialog&gt;</code> it is inside — no id to
    point at, no JavaScript, and it keeps working if <code>ui.js</code> never loads.
</p>
<Example Source="DialogCustomClose.razor"><DialogCustomClose /></Example>

